---
const title = 'Discover Chania | Freedom Wheels – Scooter Rental Chania';
const description = 'Explore Chania by scooter: old town, Venetian harbour, beaches of Agia Marina and Platanias. Freedom Wheels offers scooter rental in Chania, Crete. Book online or contact us.';
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).href;
const ogImage = new URL('/logos/logo.webp', Astro.site).href;
---
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="description" content={description} />
		<link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:title" content={title} />
		<meta property="og:description" content={description} />
		<meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
		<meta property="og:image" content={ogImage} />
		<meta property="og:locale" content="el_GR" />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content={title} />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content={description} />
		<meta name="twitter:image" content={ogImage} />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href="/logos/logo.webp" />
		<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/logos/logo.webp" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>{title}</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<section class="chania-hero">
			<img src="/images/chania-scooter-sea.png" alt="Explore Chania by scooter with a view of the sea" class="chania-hero__img" />
		</section>
		<header class="nav-bar nav-bar--scrolled" id="nav-bar">
			<div class="nav-bar__inner">
				<a href="/" class="logo">
					<img src="/logos/logo.webp" alt="Freedom Wheels" class="logo__image" />
				</a>
				<nav class="nav-bar__links">
					<a href="/rentals" class="nav-bar__link">Rentals</a>
					<a href="/chania" class="nav-bar__link nav-bar__link--active">Chania</a>
					<a href="/about" class="nav-bar__link">About us</a>
					<a href="/contact" class="nav-bar__link">Contact</a>
					<a href="/book" class="nav-bar__cta">Book now</a>
				</nav>
			</div>
		</header>

		<main class="page page--image-top">
			<section class="discover-chania">
				<div class="discover-chania__content">
					<h2 class="discover-chania__title">Vamos - Kefalas - Kokkino Xorio - Gavalochori - Douliana - Vamos</h2>
					<p class="discover-chania__text">A 28 km asphalt route winds through well-preserved traditional neighborhoods, blending medieval, 19th-century, and modern architecture. Along the way, you'll pass impressive village churches, historic school buildings, cultivated land, and untouched nature. Views of the Northern Cretan Sea and the White Mountains accompany you throughout, with opportunities to meet locals in the village squares.</p>
					<a href="/book" class="discover-chania__btn">Book Now</a>
				</div>
				<div class="discover-chania__media">
					<img src="/images/chania%20port.jpg" alt="Group with scooters by the sea in Chania" class="discover-chania__img" />
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="discover-chania discover-chania--reverse">
				<div class="discover-chania__content">
					<h2 class="discover-chania__title">Vamos – Therissos</h2>
					<p class="discover-chania__text">A 45 km route (35 km return) along a scenic asphalt road at 1,000 m altitude offers breathtaking views over Souda Bay. The journey passes through striking natural formations and the gorges of Macheri, Diktamos, and Therisos, revealing dramatic contrasts between wild, arid hills, lush forested slopes, and old rustic villages.</p>
					<a href="/book" class="discover-chania__btn">Book Now</a>
				</div>
				<div class="discover-chania__media">
					<img src="/images/chania-scooter-sea.png" alt="Scooter ride with a view of the sea in Chania" class="discover-chania__img" />
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="discover-chania">
				<div class="discover-chania__content">
					<h2 class="discover-chania__title">Vamos - Georgoupoli - Lake Kournas - waterfalls of Argiroupoli</h2>
					<p class="discover-chania__text">A 25 km journey along a pleasant asphalt road, with the White Mountains stretching out on the right and views over Georgioupoli Bay on the left. After Georgioupoli, stop at the lake to explore its rich flora and fauna by pedalo, then continue toward Argyroupoli via Kournas village, surrounded by lush greenery and freshwater waterfalls.</p>
					<a href="/book" class="discover-chania__btn">Book Now</a>
				</div>
				<div class="discover-chania__media">
					<img src="/images/chania%20port.jpg" alt="Group with scooters by the sea in Chania" class="discover-chania__img" />
				</div>
			</section>
			<section class="discover-chania discover-chania--reverse">
				<div class="discover-chania__content">
					<h2 class="discover-chania__title">Vamos - Kalamitsi Aleksandrou - Vrises - Alikambos - Vafes – Tzitzifes - Fres - Pemonia - Kania - Vamos</h2>
					<p class="discover-chania__text">A 28 km easy asphalt route through traditional villages and lush green forest roads. Enjoy a stop in Vrisses for Greek yogurt with honey under the large plane trees by the river, followed by wine tasting at Dourakis, one of the finest Cretan wine producers, in Alikampos. The route continues through the unspoiled villages of Vafes and Tzitzifes, ending with a relaxing coffee in the beautiful square of Fre.</p>
					<a href="/book" class="discover-chania__btn">Book Now</a>
				</div>
				<div class="discover-chania__media">
					<img src="/images/chania-scooter-sea.png" alt="Scooter ride with a view of the sea in Chania" class="discover-chania__img" />
				</div>
			</section>
		<footer class="site-footer">
			<div class="site-footer__inner">
				<div class="site-footer__col site-footer__company">
					<div class="site-footer__logo">
						<img src="/logos/logo.webp" alt="Freedom Wheels" class="site-footer__logo-img" />
						<span class="site-footer__name">FREEDOM WHEELS</span>
					</div>
					<ul class="site-footer__contact">
						<li>
							<span class="site-footer__icon" aria-hidden="true">📍</span>
							<span>7 Apokoronou Str, 73100 Chania, Crete, Greece</span>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="site-footer__icon" aria-hidden="true">📞</span>
							<a href="tel:+302821405794">+30 2821 405 794</a>
						</li>
						<li>
							<span class="site-footer__icon" aria-hidden="true">✉️</span>
							<a href="mailto:info@freedomwheels.gr">info@freedomwheels.gr</a>
						</li>
						<li><span>GEMI No.: —</span></li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="site-footer__col site-footer__links">
					<h3 class="site-footer__heading">About</h3>
					<ul>
						<li><a href="/#terms">Rental Terms</a></li>
						<li><a href="/#policy">Booking & Cancellation Policy</a></li>
						<li><a href="/#cookies">Cookie Policy</a></li>
						<li><a href="/#terms-use">Terms of Use</a></li>
						<li><a href="/#privacy">Privacy Policy</a></li>
						<li><a href="/#payment">Payment Methods</a></li>
						<li><a href="/contact">Contact</a></li>
					</ul>
				</div>
				<div class="site-footer__col site-footer__hours">
					<h3 class="site-footer__heading">Opening Hours</h3>
					<p class="site-footer__hours-text">Mon - Fri: 09:00 - 19:00</p>
					<p class="site-footer__hours-text">Sat: 09:00 - 14:00</p>
					<p class="site-footer__hours-text">Sun: Closed</p>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="site-footer__bottom">
				<p class="site-footer__copyright">Copyright 2026 © Freedom Wheels · Powered by <a href="https://www.itdev.gr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">IT DEV</a></p>
			</div>
		</footer>

		<style>
			:root {
				--font-heading: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
				--font-body: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
			}

			*,
			*::before,
			*::after {
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			html,
			body {
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				background-color: #ffffff;
				color: #1a1a1a;
			}

			body {
				min-height: 100vh;
			}

			.page {
				padding-top: 70px;
			}

			.page--image-top {
				padding-top: 0;
			}

			.nav-bar {
				position: fixed;
				top: 0;
				left: 0;
				right: 0;
				z-index: 30;
				background-color: transparent;
				backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
				transition: background-color 200ms ease-out, box-shadow 200ms ease-out;
			}

			.nav-bar--scrolled {
				background-color: rgba(85, 83, 86, 0.5);
				box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
			}

			.nav-bar__inner {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				gap: 2rem;
			}

			.logo {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.65rem;
				color: #ffffff;
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.logo__image {
				height: 48px;
				width: auto;
				display: block;
			}

			.logo__text {
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				font-size: 0.7rem;
				letter-spacing: 0.24em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				white-space: nowrap;
				font-weight: 500;
			}

			.nav-bar__links {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.5rem;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
			}

			.nav-bar__link {
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				background-color: rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.85);
				color: #ffffff;
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-weight: 500;
				letter-spacing: 0.12em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: background-color 150ms ease-out;
			}

			.nav-bar__link:hover,
			.nav-bar__link--active {
				background-color: rgba(100, 100, 100, 0.95);
				color: #ffffff;
			}

			.nav-bar__cta {
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
				border-radius: 999px;
				background-color: #1a1a1a;
				color: #ffffff;
				font-size: 0.75rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				letter-spacing: 0.14em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: background-color 150ms ease-out;
			}

			.nav-bar__cta:hover {
				background-color: #333;
			}

			.chania-hero {
				width: 100%;
				height: 76.5vh;
				max-height: 76.5vh;
				overflow: hidden;
			}

			.chania-hero__img {
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				display: block;
				object-fit: cover;
			}

			.discover-chania {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
				min-height: 0;
			}

			.discover-chania__content {
				background: #fff;
				padding: 3rem 2.5rem;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				text-align: center;
			}

			.discover-chania__title {
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2.5vw, 1.5rem);
				font-weight: 700;
				letter-spacing: 0.12em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
				color: #1a1a1a;
				margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
				line-height: 1.2;
			}

			.discover-chania__text {
				max-width: 420px;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				line-height: 1.65;
				color: #333;
				margin: 0 0 2rem;
			}

			.discover-chania__btn {
				display: inline-block;
				padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
				background-color: #f0ebe0;
				color: #1a1a1a;
				border: 1px solid #1a1a1a;
				border-radius: 6px;
				font-family: var(--font-body);
				font-size: 0.9rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: background-color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
			}

			.discover-chania__btn:hover {
				background-color: #e8e2d6;
				border-color: #333;
			}

			.discover-chania__media {
				overflow: hidden;
				min-height: 320px;
			}

			.discover-chania__img {
				width: 100%;
				height: 100%;
				display: block;
				object-fit: cover;
				min-height: 320px;
			}

			.discover-chania--reverse .discover-chania__content {
				order: 2;
			}

			.discover-chania--reverse .discover-chania__media {
				order: 1;
			}

			@media (max-width: 768px) {
				.discover-chania {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
				}

				.discover-chania__content {
					order: 1;
				}

				.discover-chania__media {
					order: 2;
					min-height: 280px;
				}

				.discover-chania__img {
					min-height: 280px;
				}

				.discover-chania--reverse .discover-chania__content {
					order: 1;
				}

				.discover-chania--reverse .discover-chania__media {
					order: 2;
				}
			}

			.site-footer {
				background-color: #1d8299;
				color: #fff;
				padding: 3rem 2rem 0;
				font-family: var(--font-body);
			}

			.site-footer__inner {
				max-width: 1200px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				display: flex;
				gap: 3rem;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				padding-bottom: 2rem;
			}

			.site-footer__col {
				flex: 1 1 200px;
				min-width: 0;
			}

			.site-footer__company {
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 1rem;
			}

			.site-footer__logo {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.75rem;
			}

			.site-footer__logo-img {
				height: 48px;
				width: auto;
				object-fit: contain;
			}

			.site-footer__name {
				font-size: 1.25rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				letter-spacing: 0.05em;
				color: #fff;
			}

			.site-footer__contact {
				list-style: none;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				gap: 0.5rem;
			}

			.site-footer__contact li {
				display: flex;
				align-items: flex-start;
				gap: 0.5rem;
			}

			.site-footer__icon {
				flex-shrink: 0;
			}

			.site-footer__contact a,
			.site-footer__contact span {
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}

			.site-footer__contact a:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
			}

			.site-footer__heading {
				font-size: 1.1rem;
				font-weight: 600;
				margin: 0 0 1rem;
				color: #fff;
				letter-spacing: 0.02em;
			}

			.site-footer__links ul {
				list-style: none;
				margin: 0;
				padding: 0;
			}

			.site-footer__links li {
				margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
			}

			.site-footer__links a {
				color: #fff;
				text-decoration: none;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}

			.site-footer__links a:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
			}

			.site-footer__hours-text {
				margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
				color: #fff;
			}

			.site-footer__bottom {
				border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);
				padding: 1rem 2rem;
				text-align: left;
			}

			.site-footer__copyright {
				margin: 0;
				font-size: 0.85rem;
				color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
			}

			.site-footer__copyright a {
				color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.site-footer__copyright a:hover {
				text-decoration: underline;
			}

			@media (max-width: 900px) {
				.site-footer__inner {
					flex-direction: column;
					gap: 2rem;
				}

				.nav-bar__links {
					display: none;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</body>
</html>
